# Modal Ignore List for Sisi Lola Project
# This prevents massive model files and local data from being uploaded to the cloud
# reducing deployment time from hours to seconds.

# Environments & Git
**/venv/
**/.git/
**/__pycache__/
**/.env
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Virtual Env artifacts
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# Heavy Machine Learning Models (They should live in Modal Volumes)
**/ml_training/models/
**/ml_training/checkpoints/
**/cache/
**/*.safetensors
**/*.pth
**/*.bin
**/*.ckpt
**/*.pt

# Large Media Assets (No need to re-upload existing videos/audio)
**/03_MEDIA_ASSETS/generated/
**/03_MEDIA_ASSETS/produced_vibes/
**/ml_training/data/
**/*.mp4
**/*.wav
**/*.mp3
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg

# Logs & Temp
**/logs/
**/tmp/
*.log
